      "writtenOn": "2023-06-12T03:24:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with your comment solution. It may also be an effective solution.  I chose another solution because of the some other considerations. If AIDL init at the second time，the mState should be INITILIZING. We want it to be this values. So I think it is no need to change the init state when init fail at the first time. And the code only change a little. We don\u0027t need to change more code logic.",
